ork to  be open and you can bring any analytics  reporting tool to it we have also  created dashboarding templates with  looker to help you get started quickly  if looker is your preferred tool of  choice you will find a block containing  pre-defined dashboards leveraging cortex  data foundation models in the liquor  marketplace these reports include  financial insights like accounts  receivables overdue receivables day  sales outstanding and doubtful  receivables and order to cash insights  including sales performance order  fulfillment billing pricing and more  our advanced industry solution templates  combine additional data like trends  weather and more with sap data and apply  machine learning to drive new predictive  insights  take for example our demand sensing  solution  with this template you can kickstart  insights such as identifying potential  impacts to near-term demand plans across  your most important products  for example are there any upcoming  weather events that may impact demand  what about search trends  which could cause sudden higher or lower  demand for a product  or if your marketing team is planning on  an ad to promote a product  what wasn't considered when the demand  plan was originally set  all these insights and more are possible  and while there is some intelligence and  semantics embedded in looker bigquery  and vertex ai are doing the heavy  lifting in data modeling and processing  so you can take these same insights  regardless of your choice of  visualization solution  in summary i hope you are as excited as  i am about google cloud cortex framework  and the amazing content available to  help you get started quickly  google cloud cortex framework helps you  unlock innovation by leveraging  differentiated technology to accelerate  business outcomes with less risk  complexity and cost  if you want to learn more check out  additional videos in this series thanks  for tuning in  you

